            "review_title": "Review at Back's Burger",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nAn Experience of Sheer Deliciousness\nSep 2022\nThis must be the most understated, least well known of burger joints, but to my mind at least, it is definitely the tastiest burger restaurant in the city. Other friends who have come across it also feel exactly the same way and wonder why it doesn't get the recognition it deserves. I think it is partly due to the fact that Back's Burgers do not advertise and do not promote themselves on social media. But for people in the know - these burgers will blow you away. The patty is succulent, moist and well cooked - I always opt for the 100% Australian beef combo so can't comment on the other burgers. But several friends have eaten their burgers with the pulled pork and say they are awesome. My burger comes with delicious melted cheese, mayonnaise, lettuce and tomato in a seeded bun, shoestring french fries and sides of pickled gherkins and tomato and chili sauce. If I have any complaint at all it is that if you are not careful with how you hold your bun it can break a bit easily so a firmer bun would be welcome. However, such is the level of deliciousness of the burger that the bun is a small detail, The portion size of the french fries are also very small but there again the combo is a meal deal and extra fries can always be ordered if needed. The place is a bit basic and on the small side, but it is still a very tasty culinary experience. I have eaten there endlessly, and had many deliveries and still I find myself going back for more. I don't think I am going to get fed up of Back's Burgers any time soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 20, 2022",
